		{"id":"87545b76034fdaa9","type":"text","text":"Primera comunicación \n\n![[Pasted image 20260311100103.png]]\n\n![[Pasted image 20260311100123.png]]","x":-757,"y":300,"width":515,"height":318},
		{"id":"f3e53fbb9f4622bb","type":"text","text":">[!error] Error\n\n>Si el dispositivo esta en un estado diferente de `\"online\", \"error\", \"registered\"` no puede recibir mensajes","x":-689,"y":760,"width":380,"height":100},
		{"id":"7552f512fb1966dc","type":"text","text":"Translator\n\n`handleInput()`\n\ndispositivo envía **cualquier mensaje** (sample, sync, status, etc.)","x":320,"y":193,"width":285,"height":171},
